      "requestAttempts": 1,
      "pronunciationText": "Your turn. Back to sand and salt. A student will dissolve twenty gram samples of the mixture in twenty, forty, sixty and eighty millilitres of water, then filter, and evaporate the filtrate to recover the salt. Identify the independent and dependent variables, and two controlled variables, and justify one of them. Pause here to answer.",
